 <name>lightningcss</name>
 <channel>pecl.php.net</channel>
 <summary>Lightning CSS in-process for PHP</summary>
 <description>Transform, minify, bundle, and generate source maps for CSS in-process,
backed by a statically linked, hash-verified build of Lightning CSS. No Node.js, no
external binaries, no system library dependencies. This scaffold release ships the
extension base surface (exception type, input-size ceiling INI, hardened multi-ABI
build); the CSS processing API lands next.</description>
